#, fuzzy
#| msgid ""
#| "The byte string functions perform operations on strings that are not NULL-"
#| "terminated.  See the individual man pages for descriptions of each "
#| "function."
msgid ""
"The byte string functions perform operations on strings (byte arrays)  that "
"are not necessarily null-terminated.  See the individual man pages for "
"descriptions of each function."
msgstr ""
"Las funciones de cadenas de bytes ejecutan operaciones sobre cadenas que no "
"terminan en NULL. Vea las páginas de manual individuales para las "
"descripciones de cada una de las funciones."

